To activate two-factor authentication using time-based one-time passwords, scan the QR code with your authentication app. If you don't have one, we recommend either [Google Authenticator]({google_authenticator_url}) or [Authy]({authy_url}).

{qr_code}

After scanning the code, enter the six-digit code from your app to verify the setup. If you have problems scanning the QR code, do a manual setup with code **`{code}`**.
